Subject: [PATCH 02243/11362] [outer-loop] VERIFIED license scope:
 submitter-authored solution code = CC0/MIT-0; deps stay Apache-2.0

ARC Prize 2026 rule: submitter-authored code IN THE SOLUTION must be CC0/MIT-0; 3rd-party
deps can be Apache-2.0/GPLv3. Carnot is our code -> the submission path (python/carnot/
agentic/*) must be MIT-0; verify/ + models/ + pipeline/ aren't imported by the agent so
they can stay Apache-2.0 under a carve-out. Decision pending: (A) MIT-0 carve-out of the
agentic submission modules, or (B) whole-project MIT-0 (sole authors, can do either).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
